abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the nested cyclostationary EOF operator written
  in Kim (J. Atmos. Oceanic Technol., submitted), and the scripts that
  draw Table 1 and Figs. 1–15 of that manuscript. Not the FORTRAN or MATLAB
  originals, and not eigenanalysis of a cyclostationary covariance.
